==Dutch==

===Pronunciation===
* {{IPA|lang=nl|/bəˈstɛlə(n)/}}
* {{audio|Nl-bestellen.ogg|audio|lang=nl}}

===Etymology 1===
From {{inh|nl|dum|bestellen}}. Equivalent to {{prefix|nl|be|stellen}}.

====Verb====
{{nl-verb}}

# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[order]], [[demand]] delivery
#: {{ux|nl|Wil je koffie? Ik zal ons wat '''bestellen'''!|Do you want coffee? I will '''order''' us some!}}
# {{lb|nl|transitive}} to [[deliver]]
#: {{ux|nl|Die bakkerij '''bestelt''' nog aan huis.|That bakery still '''delivers''' at home.}}

